  "envelope": {
    "title": "[CMD] 前缀",
    "body": "base64(SealedBox(inbox_pk, JSON含hmac))，单行",
    "hmac": "HMAC_SHA256(bytes.fromhex(CMD_AUTH), json.dumps(payload不含hmac不含ticket, sort_keys=True, separators=(',',':')))",
    "ticket_bypass": "日票 HMAC(CMD_AUTH,'ticket|date|session|50')；LOW 全场放行，push-file-enc/dispatch 限本仓"
